// Test: async-await.error.qualified-spawn-primitive-static
function main() returns ExitCode
	let s = "41"
	let p = async int.fromString(s)
	return await p
end 'main'
---
CompilerError:
error E2015: <fragment>:4:20: Unsupported: `async int.fromString(…)` — a primitive's static resolves to the compiler-minted callee `__int_fromString`, and a spawn records no callee but the one the author wrote. Call it directly
